"PXF arcs/ellipses, images, groups, external symbol references and "
"unrecognised records are not faithfully reconstructed. The importer reports "
"incomplete geometry and style differences; unresolved macro pins have an "
"unknown direction and cannot be published until corrected. Macro insertion "
"points are not verified terminal positions. Check each position and mapping "
"against the source. No claim of complete EPLAN compatibility is made. The "
"reference manufacturer EDZ was exercised locally; its content is not "
"distributed with ElektraWatt."
