"download is not treated as a redistribution licence. No links or embedded "
"executables are followed. Input limits: 4 MiB per XML/draft, 32 MiB "
"compressed archive, 64 MiB unpacked total, 4,096 archive entries, 512 "
"recovered candidates, 4,096 editable primitives/pins per symbol; archive "
"names, CRCs, decompression ratio and XML depth are checked."
